# Echo of Eons: each player shuffles hand and graveyard into their library and draws seven. Bot1 casts it on turn one
# with an Island and five Moxen, and again from the graveyard for its flashback cost {2}{U} on turn three, after
# which it is exiled. Every card in the decks is an Island or a Swamp, so which seven are drawn cannot matter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Echo of Eons
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x22

